# 统一换行符：文本文件在仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows(CRLF) 与 Linux/macOS(LF) 互串产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止任何转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.wav   binary
*.m4a   binary
*.zip   binary
*.xlsx  binary

# 明确语言归属（影响 diff 行为与统计）
*.py    text
*.ts    text
*.json  text
*.yaml  text
*.md    text
*.html  text
*.css   text
app/unpackage
